  <p id="c-jinshu-068-hexun-ancestry-wu060:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">曾祖<persName id="c-jinshu-068-hexun-ancestry-wu060:p001:m0002" ref="wuz_dky_0ki">齊</persName>，仕吳為名將。祖<persName id="c-jinshu-068-hexun-ancestry-wu060:p001:m0011" ref="wuz_dky_0ki_B">景</persName>，滅賊校尉。父<persName id="c-jinshu-068-hexun-ancestry-wu060:p001:m0019" ref="n40_190_783">邵</persName>，中書令，為<persName id="c-jinshu-068-hexun-ancestry-wu060:p001:m0026" ref="05e_9bb_55a">孫皓</persName>所殺，徙家屬邊郡。<persName id="c-jinshu-068-hexun-ancestry-wu060:p001:m0037" ref="626_bb5_ba2">循</persName>少嬰家難，流放海隅，吳平，乃還本郡。</p>
</text>
